<title>USA: Tweedy Browne group sells Accel stake.</title>
<headline>Tweedy Browne group sells Accel stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group including Tweedy, Browne Co L.P. said on Wednesday that it sold its stake of about 5.0 percent in it Accel International Corp.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it sold 246,000 common shares of Accel on August 20 for $2.50 a share.</p>
<p>Tweedy Browne is a New York-based broker-dealer and investment adviser.</p>
</text>
